          <attvalue for="research_unit_title" value="Colonial arrival chronology" />
          <attvalue for="statement" value="John Gurney reached New England in 1638–early 1641: bounded below by his original (pre-1643) Weymouth grants and his 1641 presence, and above by the sharp post-1640 falloff of the Great Migration." />
          <attvalue for="date_summary" value="event: 1638–early 1641" />
